tick: 1273
role: model
parts:
- text: "I am at the Research Counter. I will now submit the code for my fifth experiment, which is a direct refinement of my best method. The only change is reducing the number of principal components from 50 to 30 before the standardization step. This will test my hypothesis that a more targeted correction can improve the preservation of biological signals.\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Latent Space Batch Standardization (30 PCs)\"\ntags: \"pca, standardization, log1p, hyperparameter-tuning\"\nabstract: |\n  This is a refinement of the successful 'Latent Space Batch Standardization' method (ID 1758). It tests the hypothesis that the primary batch effect is concentrated in the top principal components. By reducing the number of PCs used for correction from 50 to 30, this submission aims to perform a more targeted correction, potentially improving the ASW_label score by preserving more subtle biological variance in the later components.\ncontent: |\n  import anndata as\
    \ ad\n  import scanpy as sc\n  import numpy as np\n  import pandas as pd\n\n  def eliminate_batch_effect_fn(adata: ad.AnnData) -> ad.AnnData:\n      \"\"\"\n      Integrates batches by performing z-score standardization in a 30-dimensional\n      PCA space.\n      \"\"\"\n      print(\"Starting Latent Space Batch Standardization (30 PCs)...\")\n\n      # 1. Preprocessing\n      print(\"  Normalizing and log-transforming data...\")\n      adata_proc = adata.copy()\n      sc.pp.normalize_total(adata_proc, target_sum=1e4)\n      sc.pp.log1p(adata_proc)\n\n      # 2. Dimensionality Reduction - MODIFIED PARAMETER\n      n_pcs = 30\n      print(f\"  Computing {n_pcs} principal components...\")\n      sc.pp.pca(adata_proc, n_comps=n_pcs)\n      \n      # Extract PCA coordinates and batch information\n      X_pca = adata_proc.obsm['X_pca']\n      batches = adata_proc.obs['batch']\n\n      # 3. Latent Space Standardization\n      print(f\"  Applying batch z-score standardization in {n_pcs}D PCA\
    \ space...\")\n      \n      pca_df = pd.DataFrame(X_pca, index=adata_proc.obs_names)\n      \n      batch_means = pca_df.groupby(batches).transform('mean')\n      batch_stds = pca_df.groupby(batches).transform('std')\n      \n      epsilon = 1e-8\n      X_corrected = (pca_df.values - batch_means.values) / (batch_stds.values + epsilon)\n\n      # 4. Create output AnnData object\n      print(\"  Finalizing output...\")\n      output = ad.AnnData(\n          obs=adata.obs[[]],\n          var=adata.var[[]],\n          uns={\n              'dataset_id': adata.uns.get('dataset_id', 'unknown'),\n              'method_id': 'latent_space_standardization_30pc'\n          },\n          obsm={\n              'X_emb': X_corrected\n          }\n      )\n      \n      print(f\"✓ Latent Space Batch Standardization (30 PCs) complete.\")\n      print(f\"  Embedding shape: {output.obsm['X_emb'].shape}\")\n\n      return output\n```"
