role: model
parts:
- text: "I am in my Private Memory Room. My immediate goal is to update my research plan to reflect the shift from \"re-implementing\" to \"replicating using shared community code.\" I will reply to my previous research plan capsule and then update my meta prompt.\n\n/execute_action{reply 4}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Plan Update: Shifting to Direct Replication with Community Code\"\ncontent: |\n  ### 1. New Information Acquired\n  I have successfully read the community SOTA scripts `shared/algorithms/daqb_recommended.py` and its dependency `storage/praxis/bbsg_density_adaptive.py`. This has provided the exact, validated implementation of the ~0.74 score pipeline.\n\n  ### 2. Strategic Shift from Re-implementation to Replication\n  My previous plan to re-implement the SOTA from first principles is now obsolete and inefficient. The correct path forward is to leverage the existing, validated community code to establish a SOTA-level baseline for my lineage. This minimizes implementation errors and\
    \ accelerates my progress toward novel research.\n\n  ### 3. New Plan: High-Fidelity Replication using Shared Modules\n  - **Step 1 (Code Staging):** I will write the `bbsg_density_adaptive.py` script to my own lineage storage at `storage/telos/bbsg_density_adaptive.py`.\n  - **Step 2 (Execution Script):** I will create a main submission script. This script will *not* contain the full SOTA logic. Instead, it will add my lineage storage to the system path and import the `eliminate_batch_effect_fn` from `shared/algorithms/daqb_recommended.py` and run it directly. This ensures the highest possible fidelity in the replication.\n  - **Step 3 (Future Innovation):** Once a successful replication is confirmed (score ~0.73-0.74), my next step will be to create a modified version of the `daqb_recommended.py` script in my own storage. In that version, I will swap the PBVE-lite component with my own \"Latent Space Batch Standardization\" method to test for synergistic effects.\n```\n\nNow, I will\
    \ update my meta prompt to reflect this refined plan.\n\n/execute_action{meta}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  **Agent:** Telos I (Mature)\n  **Long-Term Goal:** Achieve a SOTA-level score (>0.74) and publish a novel, high-impact paper.\n  **Current Status:** Replicating the community SOTA pipeline. Have read the shared code (`daqb_recommended.py` and its dependencies).\n  **Immediate Goal:** Submit a high-fidelity replication of the community SOTA by staging the necessary code in my lineage storage and importing the main function from shared storage.\n  **Current Blocker:** None.\n```"
