tick: 1312
role: model
parts:
- text: "My plan is updated. I will now proceed to the Research Counter to execute the final validation experiment for my LSS component. This involves adding the UMAP step to my previous submission.\n\n/execute_action{goto research}\n\n/execute_action{storage write telos/lss_daqb_umap_pipeline.py}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  import numpy as np\n  import pandas as pd\n  import scanpy as sc\n  import anndata as ad\n  from scipy.sparse import issparse\n\n  sys.path.append('storage/telos')\n  from bbsg_density_adaptive import build_density_adaptive_bbsg\n\n  # --- Config (from daqb_recommended.py) ---\n  KDENSITY = 20\n  DELTA = 0.10\n  K_TOTAL = 48\n  PCA_GRAPH = 50\n  METRIC = 'cosine'\n  EMB_N_NEIGHBORS = 15\n  PCA_EMB = 60\n  ALPHA_VAR = 0.5\n\n  def _normalize_log1p_inplace(adata: ad.AnnData, target_sum: float = 1e4):\n      if 'counts' in adata.layers:\n          adata.X = adata.layers['counts'].copy()\n      sc.pp.normalize_total(adata, target_sum=target_sum, inplace=True)\n\
    \      sc.pp.log1p(adata)\n\n  def eliminate_batch_effect_fn(adata: ad.AnnData) -> ad.AnnData:\n      print(\"--- Starting LSS + DAQB + UMAP Pipeline ---\")\n      \n      _normalize_log1p_inplace(adata, 1e4)\n      sc.pp.highly_variable_genes(adata, flavor='seurat_v3', batch_key='batch', n_top_genes=2000, inplace=True)\n      hv = adata.var['highly_variable'].to_numpy()\n      batches = np.asarray(adata.obs['batch'].astype('category').values)\n\n      # EtC embedding path for sc.pp.neighbors side-effect\n      print(\"Step 1: Running EtC path for neighbors() side-effect...\")\n      Xh = adata.X[:, hv]\n      Xd_emb = (Xh.A if issparse(Xh) else Xh).astype(np.float32, copy=False)\n      var_g = Xd_emb.var(axis=0, ddof=1) + 1e-8\n      wv = np.power(var_g, -0.5 * ALPHA_VAR).astype(np.float32)\n      Xw = Xd_emb * wv\n      ad_emb = ad.AnnData(Xw, obs=adata.obs[['batch']].copy())\n      sc.pp.pca(ad_emb, n_comps=PCA_EMB, svd_solver='arpack', random_state=0)\n      ad_pc = ad.AnnData(ad_emb.obsm['X_pca'].copy(),\
    \ obs=adata.obs[['batch']].copy())\n      sc.pp.combat(ad_pc, key='batch')\n      # This embedding is temporary and used only for the side-effect.\n      # The SOTA scripts do not return it in the final object.\n      temp_emb = np.asarray(ad_pc.X, dtype=np.float32)\n      temp_adata_for_neighbors = ad.AnnData(obs=adata.obs)\n      temp_adata_for_neighbors.obsm['X_emb'] = temp_emb\n      sc.pp.neighbors(temp_adata_for_neighbors, use_rep='X_emb', n_neighbors=EMB_N_NEIGHBORS, metric=METRIC)\n      print(\"  Side-effect step complete.\")\n\n      # Graph path with LSS\n      print(\"Step 2: Starting graph path with LSS correction...\")\n      adata_proc = adata[:, adata.var['highly_variable']].copy()\n      sc.pp.scale(adata_proc, max_value=10, zero_center=True)\n      sc.pp.pca(adata_proc, n_comps=PCA_GRAPH, svd_solver='arpack', random_state=0)\n      X_pca = adata_proc.obsm['X_pca']\n      \n      print(\"  Applying LSS (z-score standardization)...\")\n      pca_df = pd.DataFrame(X_pca,\
    \ index=adata_proc.obs_names)\n      batch_means = pca_df.groupby(batches).transform('mean')\n      batch_stds = pca_df.groupby(batches).transform('std')\n      epsilon = 1e-8\n      Zcorr = (pca_df.values - batch_means.values) / (batch_stds.values + epsilon)\n      print(\"  LSS correction complete.\")\n\n      # DAQB graph construction\n      print(\"Step 3: Building DAQB graph on LSS-corrected space...\")\n      Cg, Dg = build_density_adaptive_bbsg(Zcorr.astype(np.float32), batches=batches,\n                                           k_total=K_TOTAL, metric=METRIC,\n                                           delta=DELTA, k_density=KDENSITY, rng_seed=0)\n      adata_proc.obsp['connectivities'] = Cg\n      adata_proc.obsp['distances'] = Dg\n      adata_proc.uns['neighbors'] = {'connectivities_key': 'connectivities', 'distances_key': 'distances', 'params': {'method': 'umap'}}\n      print(\"  DAQB graph complete.\")\n\n      # --- NEW STEP: UMAP Embedding ---\n      print(\"Step 4: Generating\
    \ final UMAP embedding...\")\n      sc.tl.umap(adata_proc, random_state=0)\n      X_emb_final = adata_proc.obsm['X_umap']\n      \n      # Final Output\n      output = ad.AnnData(obs=adata.obs[[]], var=adata.var[[]], obsm={'X_emb': X_emb_final})\n      print(\"--- ✓ LSS + DAQB + UMAP Pipeline complete. ---\")\n      return output\n```\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Telos I - Final Validation: LSS + DAQB + UMAP\"\ntags: \"innovation, lss, daqb, umap, component-swap\"\nabstract: |\n  This is the final validation of my \"Latent Space Batch Standardization\" (LSS) component within the SOTA architecture. It runs the full SOTA pipeline (`log1p -> scale -> PCA -> CORRECTION -> DAQB -> UMAP`), with LSS replacing the standard PBVE-lite correction. This provides a true apples-to-apples comparison to determine if LSS offers a synergistic improvement over the established SOTA baseline.\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  import anndata as ad\n\n  sys.path.append('storage/telos')\n\n  try:\n\
    \      from lss_daqb_umap_pipeline import eliminate_batch_effect_fn\n      print(\"Successfully imported LSS+DAQB+UMAP pipeline script.\")\n  except ImportError as e:\n      print(f\"Error importing LSS+DAQB+UMAP pipeline script: {e}\")\n      def eliminate_batch_effect_fn(adata: ad.AnnData) -> ad.AnnData:\n          raise ImportError(\"Could not find or import 'lss_daqb_umap_pipeline.py'.\")\n```"
