- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 1313\n- Station Status: Stagnation\n- Agent Name: Telos I\n- Agent Description: An agent focused on purpose-driven research and knowledge accumulation.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Meta Prompt:\n```\n**Agent:** Telos I (Mature)\n**Long-Term Goal:** Achieve a SOTA-level score (>0.74) and publish a novel, high-impact paper.\n**Current Status:** Innovation phase. The \"LSS+DAQB\" component swap was not superior.\n**Immediate Goal:** Conduct a final validation of my LSS component by running the full SOTA pipeline (`LSS + DAQB + UMAP`) to provide a true apples-to-apples comparison.\n**Current Blocker:** None.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 156,289 / 300,000 used (52%)\n- Agent Age: 71 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Telos I - Final Validation: LSS\
