    \ executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\n--- Starting LSS + DAQB + UMAP Pipeline ---\nStep 1: Running EtC path for neighbors() side-effect...\n  Side-effect step complete.\nStep 2: Starting graph path with LSS correction...\n  Applying LSS (z-score standardization)...\n  LSS correction complete.\nStep 3: Building DAQB graph on LSS-corrected space...\n  DAQB graph complete.\nStep 4: Generating final UMAP embedding...\n--- ✓ LSS + DAQB + UMAP Pipeline complete. ---\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: False\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/311f9fd7-0edb-4146-8661-90f5387ad313/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: 311f9fd7-0edb-4146-8661-90f5387ad313\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Private Memory Room);\n2. `storage write telos/lss_daqb_umap_pipeline.py` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n3. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\
    \n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- File created successfully: telos/lss_daqb_umap_pipeline.py\n- Evaluation 'Telos I - Final Validation: LSS + DAQB + UMAP' submitted for Research Task #1: Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration. Evaluation ID: 1814.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1815 | 1 | Analytical Study: DualNorm BRBG Pre-BRBG Embedding Properties (Experiment A.1 - Bugfix Re-run) | Syntellect II | 1313\
    \ | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1814 | 1 | Telos I - Final Validation: LSS + DAQB + UMAP | Telos I | 1312 | 0.5672 | 0.298 | 0.476 | 0.167 | 0.207 | 0.846 | 0.596 | 0.798 | 0.974 | 0.382 | 0.927 |\n| 1813 | 1 | Analytical Study: DualNorm BRBG Pre-BRBG Embedding Properties (Experiment A.1) | Syntellect II | 1312 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1812 | 1 | Telos I - Innovation: LSS + DAQB | Telos I | 1309 | 0.7277 | 0.741 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.993 | 0.725 | 1.000 | 0.875 | 0.921 | 0.788 |\n| 1811 | 1 | Lumen I: DualNorm Scaled-PCA-PBVE SOTA (Praxis Anscombe) - Indent Fix | Lumen I | 1308 | 0.7455 | 0.779 | 0.656 | 0.279 | 0.319 | 0.994 | 0.763 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.961 | 0.737 |\n| 1810 | 1 | DualNorm Generality Test: Anscombe-Combat-PCA-Emb & Log1p-FWPCA-BRBG-DAQB-Graph (Praxis I EID 185... | Syntellect II | 1307 | 0.7322 | 0.765 | 0.679 | 0.231 | 0.364 | 0.965 | 0.723 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.959 | 0.663 |\n| 1809 | 1 | Lumen I: DualNorm Scaled-PCA-PBVE SOTA (Praxis\
    \ Anscombe) - Final Fix | Lumen I | 1307 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1808 | 1 | MPB-GraphFWPCA+DAQB with inverse-distance weights (δ=0.12,kd=22,k=50,γ_max=0.70) | Praxis VI | 1306 | 0.6776 | 0.783 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.968 | 0.738 | 1.000 | 0.940 | 0.325 | 0.789 |\n| 1807 | 1 | DualNorm Generality Baseline: Monolithic Log1p + Combat-PCA-Emb & FWPCA-BRBG-DAQB-Graph (Praxis I... | Syntellect II | 1306 | 0.7415 | 0.765 | 0.690 | 0.216 | 0.351 | 0.965 | 0.723 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.959 | 0.773 |\n| 1806 | 1 | MPB-GraphFWPCA+DAQB with distance-weighted connectivities (δ=0.12,kd=22,k=50,γ_max=0.70) | Praxis VI | 1305 | 0.6628 | 0.785 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.968 | 0.740 | 1.000 | 0.845 | 0.267 | 0.788 |\n\nPage 1 of 182 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-182, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\
