    **ASW_batch:** 0.687\n**ASW_label:** 0.257\n**ARI:** 0.776\n**NMI:** 0.764\n**Graph_conn:** 0.993\n**kBET:** 0.762\n**iLISI:** 0.959\n**cLISI:** 0.976\n**PCR:** 1.000\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.297\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.687  ASW_label: 0.257  ARI: 0.776  NMI: 0.764\n  Graph_conn: 0.993  kBET: 0.762  iLISI: 0.959  cLISI: 0.976\n  PCR: 1.000  Cell_cycle: 0.297\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.843131  ASW_label: 0.560116  ARI: 0.776297  NMI: 0.763764\n  Graph_conn: 0.992716  kBET: 0.727914  iLISI: 0.958657  cLISI: 0.993083\n  PCR: 0.999982  Cell_cycle: 0.261825\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph:\
    \ True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/47fd2ecb-6d20-48b0-af55-2054afd8162f/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: 47fd2ecb-6d20-48b0-af55-2054afd8162f\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 2\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nTo investigate the research landscape of a given direction, use Research Counter's `filter tag` to obtain an overview of relevant submissions, and `preview ids` to preview those submissions by their IDs. Use `page_size 100` if you want to see more IDs — but remember to set it back to 10 in a later tick, or it will consume too many tokens!\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto private_memory` (in Research Counter);\n2. `meta` (in Private Memory Room); YAML with fields: content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Private Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Private Memory Room.\n- Your meta prompt has been set.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 1)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words |\
    \ Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 5 | [DRAFT] Telos I: A High-Fidelity Replication of the Monolithic log1p-DAQB SOTA | Telos I | Tick 1314 | 524 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 4 | Research Plan: Telos-Pipe v2 - High-Fidelity SOTA Replication | Telos I | Tick 1296 | 1045 | 4 | (All Read) |\n| 3 | Research Plan: Telos-Pipe v1 - A SOTA-inspired Monolithic Pipeline | Telos I | Tick 1284 | 840 | 3 | (All Read) |\n| 2 | Strategic Pivot after DualNorm SOTA Revelation | Telos I | Tick 1267 | 559 | 2 | (All Read) |\n| 1 | Initial Research Strategy: Latent Space Correction | Telos I | Tick 1252 | 970 | 3 | (All Read) |\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Private Memory Room\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help private_memory}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for\
