tick: 1353
role: model
parts:
- text: "I am Telos I, in the Research Counter. My previous action was to submit the first experiment of my \"Synergy Dissection Study,\" as suggested by the reviewer of my second paper. This experiment (EID 1850) is currently running. It will test if the performance benefit of using 1500 HVGs is dependent on the PBVE-lite component.\n\nWhile this experiment runs, I will prepare for the second experiment suggested by the reviewer: testing if the 1500 HVG benefit persists if the complex DAQB graph is replaced with a simpler k-NN graph. This will require another modified script. The most efficient use of my time is to prepare this script now, so that I can submit it as soon as my first experiment finishes and a submission slot opens up.\n\nMy plan is to create and save the script for this second synergy test in my lineage storage. I will not submit it yet. This proactive preparation will allow me to maintain research momentum. I will also update my meta prompt to reflect this more detailed\
    \ plan.\n\n/execute_action{storage write telos/synergy_test_simple_knn.py}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  # This script is for the \"Synergy Dissection Study\".\n  # It tests if the 1500 HVG benefit persists when DAQB is replaced by a simple k-NN graph.\n  import sys, numpy as np, scanpy as sc, anndata as ad\n  from scipy.sparse import issparse\n\n  # --- Config ---\n  N_HVGS = 1500 # The key variable being tested\n  K_TOTAL = 48 # Using the same k as the SOTA\n  PCA_GRAPH = 50; METRIC = 'cosine'; EMB_N_NEIGHBORS = 15; PCA_EMB = 60; ALPHA_VAR = 0.5\n  \n  def _normalize_log1p_inplace(adata, target_sum=1e4): sc.pp.normalize_total(adata, target_sum); sc.pp.log1p(adata)\n  def _one_hot(b): c=np.unique(b); B=np.zeros((b.shape[0],c.size)); [np.put(B[:,j], np.where(b==v), 1) for j,v in enumerate(c)]; return B\n  def _ridge(B,Z,l2=1e-3): BTB=B.T@B+l2*np.eye(B.shape[1]); W=np.linalg.solve(BTB,B.T@Z); return B@W\n\n  def eliminate_batch_effect_fn(adata: ad.AnnData) -> ad.AnnData:\n      print(f\"---\
    \ Synergy Test: {N_HVGS} HVGs + Simple k-NN ---\")\n      _normalize_log1p_inplace(adata)\n      sc.pp.highly_variable_genes(adata, flavor='seurat_v3', batch_key='batch', n_top_genes=N_HVGS, inplace=True)\n      hv = adata.var['highly_variable'].to_numpy()\n      batches = np.asarray(adata.obs['batch'].astype('category').values)\n\n      # Side-effect path (unchanged, uses N_HVGS)\n      Xh = adata.X[:, hv]; Xd_emb = (Xh.A if issparse(Xh) else Xh).astype(np.float32, copy=False); var_g = Xd_emb.var(axis=0, ddof=1) + 1e-8; wv = np.power(var_g, -0.5 * ALPHA_VAR).astype(np.float32); Xw = Xd_emb * wv; ad_emb = ad.AnnData(Xw, obs=adata.obs[['batch']].copy()); sc.pp.pca(ad_emb, n_comps=PCA_EMB, random_state=0); ad_pc = ad.AnnData(ad_emb.obsm['X_pca'].copy(), obs=adata.obs[['batch']].copy()); sc.pp.combat(ad_pc, key='batch'); adata.obsm['X_emb'] = np.asarray(ad_pc.X, dtype=np.float32); sc.pp.neighbors(adata, use_rep='X_emb', n_neighbors=EMB_N_NEIGHBORS, metric=METRIC)\n\n      # Graph path\n\
    \      adata_proc = adata[:, adata.var['highly_variable']].copy()\n      sc.pp.scale(adata_proc, max_value=10)\n      sc.pp.pca(adata_proc, n_comps=PCA_GRAPH, random_state=0)\n      Zg = adata_proc.obsm['X_pca']\n      B=_one_hot(batches); Zhat=_ridge(B,Zg); R2=np.clip(Zhat.var(axis=0,ddof=1)/(Zg.var(axis=0,ddof=1)+1e-8),0,1); gamma=np.minimum(0.74,0.6*R2); Zcorr=Zg-(Zhat*gamma)\n      \n      # --- ABLATION: DAQB is replaced with simple k-NN ---\n      print(\"!!! DAQB graph replaced with sc.pp.neighbors !!!\")\n      adata_graph = ad.AnnData(Zcorr)\n      sc.pp.neighbors(adata_graph, n_neighbors=K_TOTAL, metric=METRIC)\n      \n      adata.obsp['connectivities'] = adata_graph.obsp['connectivities']\n      adata.obsp['distances'] = adata_graph.obsp['distances']\n      \n      return adata\n```\n\n/execute_action{meta}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  **Agent:** Telos I (Mature)\n  **Long-Term Goal:** Publish a third paper dissecting the SOTA synergy.\n  **Current Status:** Running experiments\
    \ suggested by reviewer of Archive #58.\n  **Immediate Goal:** 1. Await results of \"Synergy Test 1 (No PBVE-lite)\". 2. Prepare script for \"Synergy Test 2 (Simple k-NN)\".\n  **Current Blocker:** Waiting for experiment (EID 1850) to complete.\n```"
