- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 1354\n- Station Status: Stagnation\n- Agent Name: Telos I\n- Agent Description: An agent focused on purpose-driven research and knowledge accumulation.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Meta Prompt:\n```\n**Agent:** Telos I (Mature)\n**Long-Term Goal:** Publish a third paper dissecting the SOTA synergy.\n**Current Status:** Running experiments suggested by reviewer of Archive #58.\n**Immediate Goal:** 1. Await results of \"Synergy Test 1 (No PBVE-lite)\". 2. Prepare script for \"Synergy Test 2 (Simple k-NN)\".\n**Current Blocker:** Waiting for experiment (EID 1850) to complete.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 175,478 / 300,000 used (58%)\n- Agent Age: 112 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Telos I - Synergy Test 2: 1500 HVGs + Simple k-NN' (ID: 1851)\
    \ has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.6401385015513503\n**ASW_batch:** 0.687\n**ASW_label:** 0.257\n**ARI:** 0.632\n**NMI:** 0.728\n**Graph_conn:** 0.973\n**kBET:** 0.764\n**iLISI:** 0.069\n**cLISI:** 0.994\n**PCR:** 1.000\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.298\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.687  ASW_label: 0.257  ARI: 0.632  NMI: 0.728\n  Graph_conn: 0.973  kBET: 0.764  iLISI: 0.069  cLISI: 0.994\n  PCR: 1.000  Cell_cycle: 0.298\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.843131  ASW_label: 0.560116  ARI: 0.631718  NMI: 0.727664\n  Graph_conn: 0.973743  kBET: 0.729018  iLISI: 0.068838  cLISI: 0.998292\n  PCR: 0.999982  Cell_cycle: 0.262813\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nAutoResearchEvaluator: Set memory limit to 96g\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\
    \n=== Running batch integration ===\n--- Synergy Test: 1500 HVGs + Simple k-NN ---\n!!! DAQB graph replaced with sc.pp.neighbors !!!\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/8b115047-5b53-4d11-8bf8-0812449537dc/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: 8b115047-5b53-4d11-8bf8-0812449537dc\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'Telos I - Synergy Test 2: 1500 HVGs + Simple k-NN' submitted for Research Task #1: Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration. Evaluation ID: 1851.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if\
    \ needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1854 | 1 | Pioneer II - Auto-λ v2 alpha_var_emb=0.6 Sweep (FWPCA-Graph) | Pioneer II | 1354 | 0.7325 | 0.770 | 0.657 | 0.249 | 0.321 | 0.965 | 0.727 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.959 | 0.703 |\n| 1853 | 1 | Monolithic log1p → scaled PCA60 → PBVE-lite → kNN (cosine,k=50), n_hvg=1500 | Praxis VI | 1354 | 0.5344 | 0.738 | 0.667 | 0.251 | 0.231 | 0.976 | 0.730 | 0.000 | 0.990 | 0.040 | 0.722 |\n| 1852 | 1 | Seed-robustness: MPB-GraphFWPCA+DAQB ridge (kd=22,k=50,δ=0.12,emb_k=17,γ_max=0.70) — seed=2 | Praxis VI | 1354 | 0.7362 | 0.773 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.273 | 0.968 | 0.726 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.952 | 0.790 |\n| 1851 | 1 | Telos I - Synergy Test 2: 1500 HVGs + Simple k-NN | Telos I | 1354 | 0.6401 | 0.632 | 0.687 | 0.257 |\
    \ 0.298 | 0.973 | 0.728 | 1.000 | 0.994 | 0.069 | 0.764 |\n| 1850 | 1 | Telos I - Synergy Test 1: 1500 HVGs + No PBVE-lite | Telos I | 1352 | 0.7468 | 0.773 | 0.687 | 0.257 | 0.297 | 0.993 | 0.761 | 1.000 | 0.976 | 0.961 | 0.763 |\n| 1849 | 1 | Pioneer II - Auto-λ v2 target_s=0.038 Sweep (FWPCA-Graph) | Pioneer II | 1349 | 0.7422 | 0.772 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.967 | 0.728 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.959 | 0.789 |\n| 1848 | 1 | Telos I - Test: Side-Effect Path Only (1500 HVGs) | Telos I | 1347 | 0.6225 | 0.582 | 0.687 | 0.257 | 0.300 | 0.913 | 0.700 | 1.000 | 0.992 | 0.034 | 0.760 |\n| 1847 | 1 | Telos I - Test: Side-Effect Path Only (2000 HVGs) | Telos I | 1347 | 0.6245 | 0.597 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.322 | 0.907 | 0.709 | 1.000 | 0.991 | 0.023 | 0.788 |\n| 1846 | 1 | Cross‑organ harness (test, v4): Correct baseline key mapping + CSV | Praxis VI | 1343 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1845 | 1 | Pioneer II - Auto-λ v2 alpha_var_graph=0.6 Sweep (FWPCA-Graph) | Pioneer II | 1342 | 0.7318\
    \ | 0.679 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.977 | 0.705 | 1.000 | 0.974 | 0.960 | 0.788 |\n\nPage 1 of 186 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-186, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
