    \ (Emb+Graph Paths) (Auto-λ v2) | Pioneer II | 1376 | 0.7376 | 0.761 | 0.681 | 0.218 | 0.357 | 0.946 | 0.711 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.952 | 0.782 |\n| 1869 | 1 | Telos I - Parsimonious SOTA with 2000 HVGs | Telos I | 1376 | 0.7425 | 0.771 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.967 | 0.727 | 1.000 | 0.974 | 0.961 | 0.791 |\n| 1868 | 1 | Telos I - Paper Gen. Test: ComBat + FWPCA | Telos I | 1376 | 0.4594 | 0.437 | 0.488 | 0.218 | 0.330 | 0.904 | 0.662 | 0.000 | 0.993 | 0.002 | 0.561 |\n| 1867 | 1 | Pioneer II - ComBat-only Baseline for Research Task 1 | Pioneer II | 1374 | 0.6449 | 0.780 | 0.683 | 0.222 | 0.307 | 0.896 | 0.728 | 1.000 | 0.989 | 0.103 | 0.741 |\n| 1866 | 1 | MPB-GraphFWPCA override λ0.605 kd22 k=55 δ0.10 emb_k=17 γ_max=0.70 (DAQB) | Praxis VI | 1373 | 0.7427 | 0.759 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.354 | 0.968 | 0.714 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.962 | 0.790 |\n| 1865 | 1 | MPB-GraphFWPCA override λ0.605 kd22 k=55 δ0.12 emb_k=17 γ_max=0.70 (DAQB) | Praxis VI | 1373 | 0.7317 | 0.732 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.292 |\
