tick: 1390
role: model
parts:
- text: "I am Telos I, in my Private Memory Room. My plan for the advanced latent space analysis is documented. It is now time to implement and execute this crucial experiment.\n\n/execute_action{goto research}\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Telos I - Advanced PC Variance & Covariance Analysis\"\ntags: \"mechanistic-study, fwpca, hvg, variance-regularization, covariance, analysis\"\nabstract: |\n  This analytical probe replicates the advanced diagnostic panel from Praxis VI (Archive #56) on my four key experimental conditions. It uses the test() function to compute metrics for PC variance uniformity (CV, Gini) and inter-PC covariance. The goal is to provide a definitive, community-standard quantitative explanation for the synergy between 1500 HVG selection and FWPCA, forming the core evidence for my fourth paper.\ncontent: |\n  import anndata as ad\n  import scanpy as sc\n  import numpy as np\n  from scipy.sparse import issparse\n\n  def eliminate_batch_effect_fn(adata:\
    \ ad.AnnData) -> ad.AnnData:\n      return adata\n\n  def _gini(x):\n      x = np.asarray(x, dtype=np.float64)\n      if np.amin(x) < 0: x -= np.amin(x)\n      x += 1e-9; x = np.sort(x); index = np.arange(1, x.shape[0] + 1)\n      n = x.shape[0]\n      return ((np.sum((2 * index - n - 1) * x)) / (n * np.sum(x)))\n\n  def analyze_latent_space(adata: ad.AnnData, n_hvg: int, use_fwpca: bool, alpha_var: float = 0.5):\n      \"\"\"Helper function to calculate Praxis VI's diagnostic panel for a given condition.\"\"\"\n      title = f\"{n_hvg} HVGs, FWPCA={'On' if use_fwpca else 'Off'}\"\n      print(f\"\\n--- Analyzing Condition: {title} ---\")\n      \n      adata_proc = adata.copy()\n      sc.pp.highly_variable_genes(adata_proc, flavor='seurat_v3', batch_key='batch', n_top_genes=n_hvg, inplace=True, subset=True)\n      \n      X_in = (adata_proc.X.A if issparse(adata_proc.X) else adata_proc.X).astype(np.float32, copy=False)\n      \n      if use_fwpca:\n          var_g = X_in.var(axis=0,\
    \ ddof=1) + 1e-8\n          wv = np.power(var_g, -0.5 * alpha_var).astype(np.float32)\n          X_in = X_in * wv\n      \n      pca_adata = ad.AnnData(X_in, obs=adata_proc.obs)\n      sc.pp.pca(pca_adata, n_comps=50, random_state=0)\n      X_pca = pca_adata.obsm['X_pca']\n      \n      # --- Calculate Metrics ---\n      # 1. Across-PC Variance Uniformity\n      pc_variances = np.var(X_pca, axis=0)\n      pc_var_cv = np.std(pc_variances) / (np.mean(pc_variances) + 1e-8)\n      pc_var_gini = _gini(pc_variances)\n      \n      # 2. Inter-PC Covariance\n      cov_matrix = np.cov(X_pca, rowvar=False)\n      np.fill_diagonal(cov_matrix, 0)\n      cov_abs_offdiag_mean = np.mean(np.abs(cov_matrix))\n      \n      results = {\n          \"title\": title,\n          \"pc_var_cv\": pc_var_cv,\n          \"pc_var_gini\": pc_var_gini,\n          \"cov_abs_offdiag_mean\": cov_abs_offdiag_mean\n      }\n      \n      print(f\"  pc_var_cv: {pc_var_cv:.4f}, pc_var_gini: {pc_var_gini:.4f}, cov_abs_offdiag_mean:\
    \ {cov_abs_offdiag_mean:.4f}\")\n      return results\n\n  def test(adata: ad.AnnData):\n      \"\"\"Runs a 2x2 analysis using Praxis VI's diagnostic panel.\"\"\"\n      print(\"--- Starting Advanced PC Variance & Covariance Analysis ---\")\n      \n      adata_norm = adata.copy()\n      sc.pp.normalize_total(adata_norm, target_sum=1e4)\n      sc.pp.log1p(adata_norm)\n      \n      conditions = [\n          (2000, False), # A\n          (2000, True),  # B\n          (1500, False), # C\n          (1500, True)   # D\n      ]\n      \n      all_results = [analyze_latent_space(adata_norm, n, fwpca) for n, fwpca in conditions]\n      \n      print(\"\\n\\n--- FINAL SUMMARY ---\")\n      print(\"Praxis VI Diagnostic Panel (lower is better for all metrics):\")\n      for res in all_results:\n          print(f\"  {res['title']:<28}: CV={res['pc_var_cv']:.4f}, Gini={res['pc_var_gini']:.4f}, CovMean={res['cov_abs_offdiag_mean']:.4f}\")\n      print(\"--- Analysis Complete ---\")\n      \n    \
    \  return \"Advanced latent space analysis finished.\"\n```"
