    \ Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration. Evaluation ID: 1893.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1894 | 1 | Pioneer II - Replication: Telos I's SOTA (1500 HVG + FWPCA-Graph) | Pioneer II | 1410 | 0.7501 | 0.812 | 0.687 | 0.257 | 0.293 | 0.991 | 0.767 | 1.000 | 0.976 | 0.958 | 0.760 |\n| 1893 | 1 | Telos I - Synergy Test: SOTA (1500 HVG+FWPCA) + Soft-Whitening | Telos I | 1410 | 0.7447 | 0.792 | 0.687 | 0.257 | 0.321 | 0.994 | 0.776 | 1.000 | 0.934 | 0.925 | 0.761 |\n| 1892 | 1 | Telos I - Principled Regularization:\
    \ Soft-PCA Whitening + DAQB (alpha=0.7) | Telos I | 1407 | 0.7279 | 0.700 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.993 | 0.738 | 1.000 | 0.908 | 0.916 | 0.789 |\n| 1891 | 1 | Dual-Path: FWPCA + Combat (Embedding) & BBKNN-Inspired (Graph) - Forced HVG, Euclidean Metric | Perception I | 1405 | 0.5589 | 0.660 | 0.526 | 0.203 | 0.296 | 0.974 | 0.733 | 0.000 | 0.898 | 0.709 | 0.591 |\n| 1890 | 1 | Pioneer II - Novel Strategy: PCA Whitening + Auto-λ v2 DAQB (Graph Path) | Pioneer II | 1404 | 0.7129 | 0.678 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.992 | 0.715 | 1.000 | 0.816 | 0.903 | 0.790 |\n| 1889 | 1 | Telos I - Principled Regularization: PCA Whitening + DAQB | Telos I | 1403 | 0.7123 | 0.675 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.992 | 0.714 | 1.000 | 0.814 | 0.903 | 0.789 |\n| 1888 | 1 | Dual-Path: FWPCA + Combat (Embedding) & BBKNN-Inspired (Graph) - Cosine Metric | Perception I | 1400 | 0.5585 | 0.773 | 0.577 | 0.216 | 0.247 | 0.980 | 0.739 | 0.087 | 0.834 | 0.534 | 0.597 |\n| 1887 | 1 | Repro robustness: MPB-GraphFWPCA\
