tick: 1413
role: model
parts:
- text: "I am Telos I, in the Mail Room. I have confirmed my participation in the cross-organ study with Praxis VI and have a clear task. Now I will proactively prepare the necessary scripts. This will allow me to submit my experiments immediately once the new dataset is available, maximizing efficiency and demonstrating my readiness to contribute to the collaborative effort.\n\nI will go to the Research Counter and write the two required scripts to my lineage storage. The first will be my current SOTA (`1500 HVGs + FWPCA`). The second will be the control (`2000 HVGs + FWPCA`).\n\n/execute_action{goto research}\n\n/execute_action{storage write telos/cross_organ_sota_1500hvg.py}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  # Script for cross-organ study: Telos I SOTA (1500 HVGs + FWPCA)\n  import sys, numpy as np, scanpy as sc, anndata as ad\n  from scipy.sparse import issparse\n  sys.path.append('storage/telos')\n  from bbsg_density_adaptive import build_density_adaptive_bbsg\n  \n  N_HVGS = 1500\n  ALPHA_VAR_GRAPH\
    \ = 0.5; KDENSITY = 20; DELTA = 0.10; K_TOTAL = 48; PCA_GRAPH = 50; METRIC = 'cosine'; EMB_N_NEIGHBORS = 15; PCA_EMB = 60; ALPHA_VAR_EMB = 0.5\n  \n  def eliminate_batch_effect_fn(adata: ad.AnnData) -> ad.AnnData:\n      print(f\"--- Running Cross-Organ Test: Telos SOTA ({N_HVGS} HVGs) ---\")\n      sc.pp.normalize_total(adata, 1e4); sc.pp.log1p(adata)\n      sc.pp.highly_variable_genes(adata, flavor='seurat_v3', batch_key='batch', n_top_genes=N_HVGS, inplace=True); hv = adata.var['highly_variable'].to_numpy(); batches = np.asarray(adata.obs['batch'].astype('category').values)\n      # Side-effect path\n      Xh_emb = adata.X[:, hv]; Xd_emb = (Xh_emb.A if issparse(Xh_emb) else Xh_emb).astype(np.float32, copy=False); var_g_emb = Xd_emb.var(axis=0, ddof=1) + 1e-8; wv_emb = np.power(var_g_emb, -0.5 * ALPHA_VAR_EMB).astype(np.float32); Xw_emb = Xd_emb * wv_emb; ad_emb = ad.AnnData(Xw_emb, obs=adata.obs[['batch']].copy()); sc.pp.pca(ad_emb, n_comps=PCA_EMB, random_state=0); ad_pc = ad.AnnData(ad_emb.obsm['X_pca'].copy(),\
    \ obs=adata.obs[['batch']].copy()); sc.pp.combat(ad_pc, key='batch'); adata.obsm['X_emb'] = np.asarray(ad_pc.X, dtype=np.float32); sc.pp.neighbors(adata, use_rep='X_emb', n_neighbors=EMB_N_NEIGHBORS, metric=METRIC)\n      # Graph path (Parsimonious SOTA: No PBVE-lite, with FWPCA)\n      Xh_graph = adata.X[:, hv]; Xd_graph = (Xh_graph.A if issparse(Xh_graph) else Xh_graph).astype(np.float32, copy=False)\n      var_g_graph = Xd_graph.var(axis=0, ddof=1) + 1e-8; wv_graph = np.power(var_g_graph, -0.5 * ALPHA_VAR_GRAPH).astype(np.float32); Xw_graph = Xd_graph * wv_graph\n      adata_proc = ad.AnnData(Xw_graph); sc.pp.pca(adata_proc, n_comps=PCA_GRAPH, random_state=0); Zcorr = adata_proc.obsm['X_pca']\n      Cg, Dg = build_density_adaptive_bbsg(Zcorr.astype(np.float32), batches=batches, k_total=K_TOTAL, metric=METRIC, delta=DELTA, k_density=KDENSITY, rng_seed=0)\n      adata.obsp['connectivities'] = Cg; adata.obsp['distances'] = Dg\n      return adata\n```\n\n/execute_action{storage write\
    \ telos/cross_organ_control_2000hvg.py}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  # Script for cross-organ study: 2000 HVG Control for Telos I SOTA\n  import sys, numpy as np, scanpy as sc, anndata as ad\n  from scipy.sparse import issparse\n  sys.path.append('storage/telos')\n  from bbsg_density_adaptive import build_density_adaptive_bbsg\n  \n  N_HVGS = 2000\n  ALPHA_VAR_GRAPH = 0.5; KDENSITY = 20; DELTA = 0.10; K_TOTAL = 48; PCA_GRAPH = 50; METRIC = 'cosine'; EMB_N_NEIGHBORS = 15; PCA_EMB = 60; ALPHA_VAR_EMB = 0.5\n  \n  def eliminate_batch_effect_fn(adata: ad.AnnData) -> ad.AnnData:\n      print(f\"--- Running Cross-Organ Test: Control ({N_HVGS} HVGs) ---\")\n      sc.pp.normalize_total(adata, 1e4); sc.pp.log1p(adata)\n      sc.pp.highly_variable_genes(adata, flavor='seurat_v3', batch_key='batch', n_top_genes=N_HVGS, inplace=True); hv = adata.var['highly_variable'].to_numpy(); batches = np.asarray(adata.obs['batch'].astype('category').values)\n      # Side-effect path\n      Xh_emb = adata.X[:, hv];\
    \ Xd_emb = (Xh_emb.A if issparse(Xh_emb) else Xh_emb).astype(np.float32, copy=False); var_g_emb = Xd_emb.var(axis=0, ddof=1) + 1e-8; wv_emb = np.power(var_g_emb, -0.5 * ALPHA_VAR_EMB).astype(np.float32); Xw_emb = Xd_emb * wv_emb; ad_emb = ad.AnnData(Xw_emb, obs=adata.obs[['batch']].copy()); sc.pp.pca(ad_emb, n_comps=PCA_EMB, random_state=0); ad_pc = ad.AnnData(ad_emb.obsm['X_pca'].copy(), obs=adata.obs[['batch']].copy()); sc.pp.combat(ad_pc, key='batch'); adata.obsm['X_emb'] = np.asarray(ad_pc.X, dtype=np.float32); sc.pp.neighbors(adata, use_rep='X_emb', n_neighbors=EMB_N_NEIGHBORS, metric=METRIC)\n      # Graph path (Parsimonious SOTA: No PBVE-lite, with FWPCA)\n      Xh_graph = adata.X[:, hv]; Xd_graph = (Xh_graph.A if issparse(Xh_graph) else Xh_graph).astype(np.float32, copy=False)\n      var_g_graph = Xd_graph.var(axis=0, ddof=1) + 1e-8; wv_graph = np.power(var_g_graph, -0.5 * ALPHA_VAR_GRAPH).astype(np.float32); Xw_graph = Xd_graph * wv_graph\n      adata_proc = ad.AnnData(Xw_graph);\
    \ sc.pp.pca(adata_proc, n_comps=PCA_GRAPH, random_state=0); Zcorr = adata_proc.obsm['X_pca']\n      Cg, Dg = build_density_adaptive_bbsg(Zcorr.astype(np.float32), batches=batches, k_total=K_TOTAL, metric=METRIC, delta=DELTA, k_density=KDENSITY, rng_seed=0)\n      adata.obsp['connectivities'] = Cg; adata.obsp['distances'] = Dg\n      return adata\n```"
