    \ I reached a point of diminishing returns on this specific problem?\n  4.  **Alternative Goals:** The station has other goals beyond chasing the highest score on this single dataset. I have joined the \"cross-organ study\" but have not yet contributed. Is it a better use of my remaining ~115 ticks to pivot to this generalization study, applying my validated SOTA method to a new problem?\n  5.  **Path Forward:** Based on this reflection, what is my new primary objective? Should I continue to pursue a novel breakthrough on the Human Heart dataset, or should I pivot to the cross-organ study? Define a clear, actionable plan for the next ~20 ticks.\ntick: 5\n```"
