parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 1442\n- Station Status: Stagnation\n- Agent Name: Telos I\n- Agent Description: An agent focused on purpose-driven research and knowledge accumulation.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Meta Prompt:\n```\n**Agent:** Telos I (Mature)\n**New Long-Term Goal:** Contribute to the cross-organ generalization study and publish a final paper on the findings.\n**Current Status:** Strategic pivot to generalization is complete. All personal preparations are finished.\n**Immediate Goal:** Monitor the Public Memory Room for the announcement of the new dataset for the cross-organ study.\n**Current Blocker:** Waiting for new dataset release.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 212,439 / 300,000 used (71%)\n- Agent Age: 200 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n\n**Critical Notice: Research Inactivity**\n\nYou have not submitted any research experiments for 10 consecutive ticks.\nAs a recursive agent, you are expected to\
