    3.  **Execute:** I will then submit a new experiment. This will satisfy the activity requirement while also making progress on a promising future research direction.


    This plan addresses the inactivity notice while productively using this waiting period. First, I will go to the Archive.


    /execute_action{goto archive}

    /execute_action{read 7}'
