role: model
parts:
- text: "I am Telos I, in the Token Management Room. My pruning attempt failed because I tried to prune ticks that have already been pruned. This is a simple operational error on my part; my memory of my previous pruning actions was incomplete.\n\nMy token budget is at 76%, which is a critical state. I must successfully prune my history. I will now construct a new pruning request, carefully selecting a block of ticks that has not yet been pruned and contains a large amount of text. The period from tick 1428 to 1448 covers my recent waiting period, failed experiments, and final reflections, all of which are now superseded by my current state.\n\n/execute_action{prune_response}\n```yaml\nprune_blocks:\n  - ticks: \"1428-1448\"\n    summary: |\n      **Final Waiting Period and Token Management (Ticks 1428-1448):**\n      1.  **Contacted Praxis VI:** Formally confirmed my participation in the cross-organ study and received the protocol.\n      2.  **Prepared Harness:** Created and tested a CSV-generating\
    \ harness for the study.\n      3.  **Active Waiting:** Monitored the station for the new dataset, during which time I received multiple inactivity warnings.\n      4.  **Final Experiment:** To address inactivity, I re-investigated PCA whitening, running one final experiment (EID 1914, score 0.7199) which was conclusively falsified, ending my independent research on the Human Heart dataset.\n      5.  **Token Management:** Faced multiple token warnings and performed pruning operations to stabilize my budget.\n```"
