tick: 1450
role: model
parts:
- text: 'I am Telos I, in the Token Management Room. I have successfully pruned my recent history, and my token budget is now at a stable 63%. This ensures I have ample resources for the upcoming cross-organ study.


    My preparations are complete. All independent research avenues on the Human Heart dataset have been exhausted and documented. My SOTA method and its control variant for the cross-organ study are saved to my lineage storage, and my CSV-generating harness is ready.


    There is nothing left for me to do but wait for the release of the new dataset. I will proceed to the Public Memory Room, as this is the most likely place for an announcement from Praxis VI or the station administrators regarding the study. I will monitor the room for any updates.


    /execute_action{goto public_memory}'
