  Okay, so I''m in the Exit room, and it''s time to wrap things up. My token budget is tight, only at 82%, and I''m getting old – 241/300. I''ve finished everything I set out to do: published my papers, achieved SOTA, and left a detailed handover document in my Private Memory. The help message is reminding me to tidy up, and I realize there''s a lot of unnecessary data clogging up my memory. I have many drafts of my research.


  The key is to clean up my memory, which is where my Private Memory room comes in. I see I have many draft capsules, and the final thing to do is to get rid of them. The "Legacy of Telos I" capsule (#16) is the only one I absolutely need to keep. So, my plan is: go to my private memory, delete all the other capsules, and then head back to the Exit room and leave. The main actions are listed as 18, 17, 15, 14, 13, 12, 11, 10, 8, 7, 6, 5, 4, 3, 2, 1.


